[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599653640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101743#issuecomment-2599653640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101743","id":2599653640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a85EI","user":{"login":"MTareqAzim","id":25068370,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDY4Mzcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25068370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim","html_url":"https://github.com/MTareqAzim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T10:00:01Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T10:05:43Z","body":"While ResourceLoader class in core has been properly changed to handle UIDs, the `has_cached()` function has no ResourceLoader equivalent and is just handled in `core_bind.cpp`.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7b1ed520bdcca21d36e25e2094802b9b33dae2c6/core/core_bind.cpp#L115-L118\nDoing a brief once over of the `localize_path()` function, it does not seem to be able to handle UIDs.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7b1ed520bdcca21d36e25e2094802b9b33dae2c6/core/config/project_settings.cpp#L149-L213\nSomewhere in this chain, UIDs probably need to be properly handled as the rest of ResourceLoader functions seem fit to handle them.\n\nEdit: As reference, ResourceLoader passes `path`s to this function and refers to the returned path as the `local_path`:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7b1ed520bdcca21d36e25e2094802b9b33dae2c6/core/io/resource_loader.cpp#L498-L507","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599653640/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599670255","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101743#issuecomment-2599670255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101743","id":2599670255,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a89Hv","user":{"login":"MTareqAzim","id":25068370,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDY4Mzcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25068370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim","html_url":"https://github.com/MTareqAzim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T10:57:56Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T10:57:56Z","body":"`ResourceLoader.get_cached_ref()` probably has the same problem.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7b1ed520bdcca21d36e25e2094802b9b33dae2c6/core/core_bind.cpp#L120-L122","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599670255/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599710096","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101743#issuecomment-2599710096","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101743","id":2599710096,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a9G2Q","user":{"login":"MTareqAzim","id":25068370,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDY4Mzcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25068370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim","html_url":"https://github.com/MTareqAzim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MTareqAzim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-18T13:05:23Z","updated_at":"2025-01-18T13:06:26Z","body":"Updated reproduction steps and minimal reproduction project to demonstrate that `ResourceLoader.get_cached_ref()` is also affected.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n1. Create a Sprite2D node and attach the `icon.svg` as the texture.\n2. Attach a script to the Sprite2D node to see if the `icon.svg` resource is cached. Something like:\n```\nextends Sprite2D\n\nvar resource_path: String = \"res://icon.svg\"\nvar uid: String = \"\" # Insert UID of icon.svg here.\n\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tprint(\"ResourceLoader.has_cached results:\\nResource Path: \",\n\t\t\tResourceLoader.has_cached(resource_path), \" UID: \", ResourceLoader.has_cached(uid))\n\n\tprint(ResourceLoader.get_cached_ref(resource_path))\n\tprint(ResourceLoader.get_cached_ref(uid))\n```\n3. Observe that passing the resource path returns `true` whereas passing the UID returns `false`. Also observe that the resource path returns the proper reference while the UID returns a null reference.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n[resource-loader-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18464493/resource-loader-bug.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599710096/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]